This workaround seems to do the job for me : 

- find the location of jdtls in your local installation e.g.

`/home/joe/.local/share/opencode/bin/jdtls/bin/jdtls`  
( source from https://github.com/eclipse-jdtls/eclipse.jdt.ls/blob/main/org.eclipse.jdt.ls.product/scripts/jdtls )

- adapt your opencode.json file such that it starts jdtls with the jvm arg proposed by @ML-Marco :
```
{
  "$schema": "https://opencode.ai/config.json",
  "lsp": {
    "jdtls": {
      "command": [
        "/home/joe/.local/share/opencode/bin/jdtls/bin/jdtls",
        "--jvm-arg=-Djdt.ls.generatesMetadataFilesAtProjectRoot=false"
      ]
    }
  }
}
```
- restart opencode
